  irregular fibrous bands  No additional masses or cysts are noted  SECTION CODE  A B  Biopsy cavity in relation to closest deep margin  C   Biopsy cavity in relation to closest medial margin  D   Biopsy cavity in relation to overlying skin  E   Further representative sections of central hemorrhagic biopsy cavity  F   Representative section of fibrous parenchyma from mid portion of lower outer quadrant  G   Representative section of fibrous parenchyma from inferior portion of the specimen  The attached axillary tail measures REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 3 2cm  from which multiple lymph nodes are identified  ranging from 0 3cm in greatest dimension  up to REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 8cm  A representative section from each lymph node is submitted in Cassettes H O  Gross Description by  JANINE L  DUDAC                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  MGH INPATIENT  FLR UNKNOWN  REPORTS TO  Edwin Lee Carter  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   MASTECTOMY   report_end  , No.
