s   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 1 0cm fragment of fibrofatty tissue with a localizing wire in place and an attached specimen x ray  A REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x 0 6cm hard  gritty  tan nodule is present within 0 1cm of the inked surface  corresponding to a nodule on x ray  A representative section of the mass is frozen as Frozen Section  1 and saved frozen  Representative sections are submitted for estrogen receptors and BRDU studies  The remainder is submitted in A through F  mass in A and B   Resident  Cynthia E  Flynn  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     FROZEN SECTION DIAGNOSIS  1   RIGHT BREAST MASS   INFILTRATING DUCTAL CARCINOMA  O R  Resident  Andrea Flieder  MD O R  Diagnosis by  G  Richard Dickersin  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Leslie Wayne Ottinger  M D  PART   RIGHT BREAST MASS   report_end  , No.
